### Description

Create a new job template in the specified resource scope (business or business set).

Prerequisites: the caller has permission to create job templates in the scope, and holds the corresponding
view/use permissions on every referenced resource (scripts, file sources, accounts). Template names must be unique
within the same resource scope.

The array order of `step_list` is the execution order of the steps. This API does not accept step `id`; step IDs are
assigned by the server and can be read via `get_job_template_detail`.

### Request Parameters

#### Body Parameters

| Field           | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                                            |
|-----------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| bk_scope_type   | string | Yes      | Resource scope type. Allowed values: `biz` (business), `biz_set` (business set)                                                        |
| bk_scope_id     | string | Yes      | Resource scope ID matching `bk_scope_type` (business ID or business set ID)                                                            |
| name            | string | Yes      | Job template name, 1–60 characters; must not contain HTML special characters `<`, `>`, `"`, `'`; must be unique within the same scope  |
| description     | string | No       | Job template description, up to 500 characters                                                                                         |
| global_var_list | array  | No       | Global variable list; variable names must be unique within one request                                                                 |
| step_list       | array  | Yes      | Job step list; the array order is the execution order; must be non-empty                                                               |

##### global_var_list[] element

{% include '_generic_v4_template_global_var_req.md.j2' %}

##### step_list[] element

| Field         | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                     |
|---------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| name          | string | Yes      | Step name, 1–60 characters; must not contain HTML special characters `<`, `>`, `"`, `'`         |
| type          | int    | Yes      | Step type. Allowed values: `1` (script execution), `2` (file transfer), `3` (manual confirmation) |
| script_info   | object | No       | Script step detail. Required when `type` is 1                                                   |
| file_info     | object | No       | File transfer step detail. Required when `type` is 2                                            |
| approval_info | object | No       | Manual confirmation step detail. Required when `type` is 3                                      |

This API does not accept step `id`; providing it results in a parameter error.

{% include '_generic_v4_template_step_req.md.j2' %}

##### account

| Field       | Type   | Required | Description                                                                          |
|-------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| id          | long   | No       | Account ID. Mutually exclusive with `account_var`; `id` wins when both are given     |
| account_var | string | No       | Name of a global variable of type "execute account" to reference. Mutually exclusive with `id` |

At least one of `id` and `account_var` must be provided.

##### execute_target

{% include '_generic_v4_template_execute_target_req.md.j2' %}

### Request Example

- POST

```json
{
    "bk_scope_type": "biz",
    "bk_scope_id": "2",
    "name": "my-api-template",
    "description": "created by openapi",
    "global_var_list": [
        {
            "name": "TARGET_DIR",
            "type": 1,
            "description": "release directory",
            "required": 1,
            "value": "/data/release"
        },
        {
            "name": "HOST_TARGET",
            "type": 3,
            "execute_target": {
                "host_list": [
                    {
                        "bk_host_id": 10001
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ],
    "step_list": [
        {
            "name": "run-script",
            "type": 1,
            "script_info": {
                "script_type": 1,
                "script_content": "ZWNobyBoZWxsbw==",
                "script_language": 1,
                "script_timeout": 1000,
                "account": {
                    "id": 1
                },
                "execute_target": {
                    "variable": "HOST_TARGET"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "transfer-file",
            "type": 2,
            "file_info": {
                "file_source_list": [
                    {
                        "file_type": 1,
                        "file_list": [
                            "/data/app.tar.gz"
                        ],
                        "account": {
                            "id": 1
                        },
                        "execute_target": {
                            "host_list": [
                                {
                                    "bk_host_id": 10002
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "file_type": 3,
                        "file_list": [
                            "/bucket/config.yaml"
                        ],
                        "file_source_id": 7
                    }
                ],
                "file_destination": {
                    "path": "/data/release",
                    "account": {
                        "id": 1
                    },
                    "execute_target": {
                        "variable": "HOST_TARGET"
                    }
                },
                "timeout": 3600,
                "transfer_mode": 1
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "confirm",
            "type": 3,
            "approval_info": {
                "approval_type": 1,
                "approval_user": {
                    "user_list": [
                        "admin"
                    ]
                },
                "approval_message": "confirm to release",
                "notify_channel": [
                    "weixin"
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}
```

